<Legal
  title="Delete your account"
  heading="Delete your <em>account</em>"
  description="How to delete your Bao Run account and all its data, from the app or by email."
  updated="4 November 2026"
  summary="In the app: Settings, then Delete my account. Everything goes straight away."
>
  <h2>From the app</h2>
  <ol>
    <li>Open Bao Run and go to <strong>Settings</strong>.</li>
    <li>Scroll to <strong>Your account</strong> and tap <strong>Delete my account</strong>.</li>
    <li>Confirm. That's it.</li>
  </ol>

  <h2>Without your phone</h2>
  <p>Install Bao Run on any Android phone, sign in with the same email address, and delete it from Settings.</p>

  <h2>What's deleted</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Your account and email address</li>
    <li>Your plan and plan answers</li>
    <li>Every run, route, rating and note</li>
    <li>Imported watch files</li>
    <li>Health readings from Health Connect</li>
    <li>Your Strava connection</li>
  </ul>
  <p>All of it goes straight away. Copies in our hosting provider's backups expire within a short time after.
    Anonymous usage analytics, which were never linked to your name or email, may be kept for up to a year.</p>
  <p>Deleting your Bao account doesn't touch runs already on Strava or in Health Connect; those belong to those
    services.</p>
</Legal>
